        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi ekabaka Sedekia kicorak, kibwaikis Yeremia aidaris naka alaro naka ikedarak, koinanakinai ninipaaran emugati loeyaunio korot loka ikapeok, aitodol neadaunotor imugatin kere lukore. Kosalak Yeremia alaro naka ikedarak.",
